          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does ceiling paint help prevent roller marks?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Dedicated ceiling paints are flat, which hides overlaps and sheen differences better than higher sheens, and many are formulated to level well and resist spatter. Color-change ceiling paints also show where you have rolled, which helps you avoid missed spots and uneven coverage."
          }
